Sophisticated Backpacks and Storage for Horizon 26.3 (package sophisticatedcore, version 0.4.0)

A port of three Fabric 1.20.1 mods, in one package:
- Sophisticated Core 1.2.7.15.166 by P3pp3rF1y, Salandora (https://github.com/Salandora/SophisticatedCore)
- Sophisticated Backpacks 3.23.4.5.110 by P3pp3rF1y, Ridanisaurus, Salandora
  (https://github.com/Salandora/SophisticatedBackpacks)
- Sophisticated Storage 1.3.5.11.142 by P3pp3rF1y, Ridanisaurus, Salandora
  (https://github.com/Salandora/SophisticatedStorage)
Original licence: GPL-3.0 (all three)

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules of all three are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and
their content (items, blocks, textures, models, recipes and other data) is carried over from the three jars,
under their own namespaces. This port is distributed under the same licence as the originals (GPL-3.0); the
licence text is the original repositories' LICENSE (the jars have none). Built against Horizon's exact-build
SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.
